lts,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l018","ordinal":280547,"en":"When the enemy separates"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l019","ordinal":280548,"en":"Winter takes the soul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l020","ordinal":280549,"en":"A sly watcher in pain"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l021","ordinal":280550,"en":"Death has not come to an end,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l022","ordinal":280551,"en":"How can I die?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l023","ordinal":280552,"en":"Ai, Kulchoro, my gift,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l024","ordinal":280553,"en":"I am better than man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l025","ordinal":280554,"en":"My back, white road,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l026","ordinal":280555,"en":"The back is high, the thighs and arms,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l027","ordinal":280556,"en":"When my eyes passed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l028","ordinal":280557,"en":"Kanchoro is a formidable enemy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l029","ordinal":280558,"en":"Willingly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l030","ordinal":280559,"en":"Bakay and Kulchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l031","ordinal":280560,"en":"He would have done what he knew."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l032","ordinal":280561,"en":"Live without killing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l033","ordinal":280562,"en":"Kulchorom used to put you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l034","ordinal":280563,"en":"Taarynbagy Kulchorom,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l035","ordinal":280564,"en":"If the leader dies, the population dies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l036","ordinal":280565,"en":"If the boss dies, everything dies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l037","ordinal":280566,"en":"Salt with pain is forbidden"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l038","ordinal":280567,"en":"The rich are dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b003:l039","ordinal":280568,"en":"Head to Kyrgyz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1233:b005:l001","ord